  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3; totals equal the Statement of Net Position, p1, where the 366,522 is labelled Designated Deposits). Ending cash = Equity in Pooled Cash 4,753,106 and investments = Designated Investments 366,522 (p3); no beginning cash printed (beginning fund balance 4,857,550). Roll: 4,857,550 + 3,468,726 - 3,206,648 + 787,993 - 787,993 = 5,119,628. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp5-6) by department; its Taxes 2,039,771 split into Property Taxes 1,953,735 + Motor Vehicle Tax 86,036 from the General column of Exhibit D (p4); its State 26,097 / Local 369,331 and the Road Fund's State 544,062 / Local 97,305 do not tie to Exhibit D's columns (9,699 and 6 reclassified between intergovernmental and local), so kept as printed; Road 'State' kept as other state aid (no highway allocation label printed). General Fund Surveyor line has a budget (2,200) but no actual printed; not recorded. Inheritance Tax Fund 'Local' 22,788 is printed as Inheritance Tax on Exhibit D. Nonmajor funds from the combining schedules (pp9-11), one line per fund column; the nonmajor budget schedule (Schedule 4, pp12-14) prints only fund totals and is not recorded (no double counting). Noxious Weed is natural resources/conservation. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
